      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Mutations in BRCA genes are linked with hereditary ovarian cancer, influencing diagnosis and treatment options.&lt;SEP&gt;Mutations in BRCA genes can significantly increase the risk of developing ovarian cancer, making it a focal point for testing and treatment decisions.</data>
