      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">CA-125 testing is often utilized for monitoring ovarian cancer and assessing treatment effectiveness, particularly post-chemotherapy.&lt;SEP&gt;The CA-125 test is used as a tumor marker for ovarian cancer, although it cannot diagnose the disease on its own.</data>
