    <edge source="Ovarian Cancer" target="FIGO Staging System">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The FIGO staging system is utilized to assess the spread of ovarian cancer and determine treatment strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;The FIGO staging system provides a framework for categorizing ovarian cancer stages to inform treatment approaches.</data>
