    <edge source="Ovarian Cancer" target="Surgical Menopause">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The removal of ovaries during surgery for ovarian cancer leads to surgical menopause due to the sudden decline in estrogen levels.</data>
