    <edge source="Ovarian Cancer" target="Bevacizumab (Avastin)">
      <data key="d4">25.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Bevacizumab is frequently added to chemotherapy regimens for ovarian cancer to help manage tumor growth by blocking blood supply.&lt;SEP&gt;Bevacizumab is often included in treatment regimens for recurrent platinum-resistant ovarian cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Bevacizumab is used as part of the chemotherapy regimen for patients diagnosed with ovarian cancer to inhibit tumor growth.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer treatment, drug usage&lt;SEP&gt;cancer treatment, drug utilization&lt;SEP&gt;treatment, therapy</data>
