    </edge>
    <edge source="Ovarian Cancer" target="Intravenous Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Intravenous chemotherapy is a core treatment method for patients diagnosed with ovarian cancer, delivering necessary drugs directly into circulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Intravenous chemotherapy is commonly administered for ovarian cancer patients as a standard treatment method.</data>
