    <edge source="Lynch Syndrome" target="Colorectal Cancer">
      <data key="d4">19.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Individuals with Lynch syndrome have a significantly higher risk of developing colorectal cancer and should receive genetic testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Testing for Lynch syndrome is recommended for colorectal cancer patients to identify inherited cancer risks.</data>
