    <edge source="Maintenance Therapy" target="Olaparib (Lynparza)">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Olaparib is a key component in maintenance therapy for ovarian cancer patients with BRCA mutations, aimed at preventing recurrence.&lt;SEP&gt;Olaparib is administered as part of the maintenance therapy plan for patients with BRCA mutations after initial ovarian cancer treatment.</data>
