    <edge source="Metastasis" target="Advanced-Stage Prostate Cancer">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Advanced-stage prostate cancer typically involves metastasis, making treatment more challenging and necessitating specialized care.&lt;SEP&gt;Metastasis signifies the advancement of prostate cancer beyond the original site, marking a shift to advanced-stage cancer which requires different treatment approaches.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer progression, treatment challenges&lt;SEP&gt;disease progression, treatment complexity</data>
