    <edge source="primary tumor" target="metastasis">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The primary tumor is the origin point from which cancer cells may spread through metastasis to form secondary tumors in other body parts.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary tumor is the source from which cancer cells can metastasize to other parts of the body, forming secondary tumors.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer progression, tumor spread</data>
