      <data key="d7">chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="local metastasis" target="distant metastasis">
      <data key="d4">12.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Local metastasis is a form of cancer spread that occurs close to the primary tumor, unlike distant metastasis, which occurs far from the original site.&lt;SEP&gt;Local metastasis occurs closer to the primary tumor compared to distant metastasis, which affects body parts far away from the original tumor.</data>
      <data key="d6">cancer spread types, disease progression&lt;SEP&gt;spread types, cancer progression</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-c37f547042fc10baabdbfaadf010bce5</data>
    </edge>
