    <edge source="Primary CNS Lymphoma" target="HIV">
      <data key="d4">16.0</data>
      <data key="d5">HIV increases the risk of developing primary CNS lymphoma by impairing the immune system.&lt;SEP&gt;HIV is a known risk factor for developing primary CNS lymphoma due to its immunosuppressive effects on the body.</data>
