      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Having an immunodeficiency disorder increases the risk of developing primary CNS lymphoma due to inadequate immune response.&lt;SEP&gt;Having an immunodeficiency disorder is known to raise the risk of developing primary CNS lymphoma due to weakened immune defenses.</data>
