    </edge>
    <edge source="primary CNS lymphoma" target="Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d4">19.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemotherapy is a primary treatment method for managing primary CNS lymphoma, often using various drugs including methotrexate.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is used to treat primary CNS lymphoma by targeting and slowing its growth.</data>
