    </edge>
    <edge source="Stem Cell Rescue" target="High-Dose Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">High-dose chemotherapy is a pre-treatment step to destroy cancer cells before stem cell rescue is performed.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cell rescue follows high-dose chemotherapy to restore the blood-forming capabilities of the bone marrow after cancer treatment.</data>
