    <edge source="Informed Consent" target="Clinical Trials">
      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Informed consent is a critical process in clinical trials to ensure participant understanding of risks and benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;Informed consent is a critical step in the clinical trials process, ensuring that participants are fully aware of the study's risks and benefits.&lt;SEP&gt;Informed consent is essential in clinical trials, providing participants with necessary information to make educated decisions about their involvement.</data>
