    <edge source="MSI-H/dMMR mutation" target="Pembrolizumab (Keytruda)">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Pembrolizumab is commonly prescribed for treating tumors characterized by the MSI-H/dMMR mutation.</data>
