    <edge source="IDH1 mutation" target="Ivosidenib (Tibsovo)">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Ivosidenib is a targeted therapy intended for treating patients with IDH1 mutations, especially in chondrosarcoma.</data>
