    <edge source="Glioma" target="Surgery">
      <data key="d4">28.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Surgery is a key treatment for glioma, aimed at removing the tumor to improve patient health outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgery is a key treatment method for gliomas, aimed at tumor removal to improve patient prognosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgery is often the first-line treatment for gliomas and aims to reduce the tumor burden to improve patient outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d6">treatment intervention&lt;SEP&gt;treatment pathway, intervention&lt;SEP&gt;treatment relationship, intervention</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-fa5247d6b8c17e58ab315a0d641c7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Glioma" target="Radiation Therapy">
      <data key="d4">25.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Radiation therapy is a supportive treatment for gliomas used to shrink and control the growth post-surgery.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation therapy is employed to treat gliomas after surgical intervention or when surgery is not possible.&lt;SEP&gt;Radiation therapy is often administered post-surgery or when surgery isn't viable, targeting glioma cells.</data>
      <data key="d6">treatment approach, cancer management&lt;SEP&gt;treatment intervention&lt;SEP&gt;treatment relationship, intervention</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-fa5247d6b8c17e58ab315a0d641c7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Glioma" target="Chemotherapy">
      <data key="d4">24.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemotherapy is frequently part of the treatment plan for glioma patients, especially after tumor removal or during recurrence.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is used alongside surgery and radiation to target residual glioma cells and manage progression.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is utilized in the management of gliomas, especially in cases of recurring tumors.</data>
      <data key="d6">treatment intervention&lt;SEP&gt;treatment relationship, intervention&lt;SEP&gt;treatment synergy, cancer therapy</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-fa5247d6b8c17e58ab315a0d641c7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Glioma" target="Clinical Trials">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Clinical trials investigate new treatments for gliomas, often offering hope where traditional treatments have limited success.&lt;SEP&gt;Clinical trials may offer new and innovative treatment options for patients diagnosed with gliomas, providing additional hope.</data>
      <data key="d6">research advancement, treatment options&lt;SEP&gt;research opportunity</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-fa5247d6b8c17e58ab315a0d641c7ad3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da0bfe00946dcdff3a8a6fb3d73ce6e1</data>
    </edge>
