    <edge source="Cancer" target="Biopsy">
      <data key="d4">20.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A biopsy is crucial in diagnosing cancer, confirming the presence of malignant cells, and determining the appropriate treatment plan.&lt;SEP&gt;A biopsy is performed to test tissue samples for the presence of cancer, establishing a critical connection between the two.</data>
      <data key="d6">diagnosis, treatment planning&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic testing, cancer verification</data>
