    </edge>
    <edge source="Imaging Tests" target="CT Scan">
      <data key="d4">42.0</data>
      <data key="d5">CT scans are a type of imaging test used to identify the presence of cancerous lesions in the body.&lt;SEP&gt;CT scans are one type of imaging test used to investigate potential cancerous conditions."|&lt;SEP&gt;CT scans fall under the category of imaging tests used to visualize and diagnose cancer."|&lt;|"diagnostic imaging, medical assessment&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging tests, including CT scans, are important for visualizing and assessing the extent of leukemia in the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging tests, including CT scans, play a vital role in assessing the extent of leukemia and guiding treatment approaches.</data>
      <data key="d6">8&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic imaging, cancer detection&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic imaging, treatment planning&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic imaging|</data>
