    </edge>
    <edge source="Imaging Tests" target="Blood Tests">
      <data key="d4">33.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Blood tests may be performed alongside imaging tests to monitor cancer progression and treatment effects."|&lt;|"diagnostic tools, health monitoring&lt;SEP&gt;Both blood tests and imaging tests are essential diagnostic tools used to evaluate the presence and extent of breast cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;Both blood tests and imaging tests are essential diagnostics for monitoring health in cancer patients.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging tests and blood tests are complementary diagnostic tools used to assess a patient's health status and cancer progression.</data>
      <data key="d6">9&lt;SEP&gt;diagnosis, healthcare tools&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic methods, cancer assessment&lt;SEP&gt;diagnostic tests, health monitoring</data>
