    <edge source="Chemotherapy" target="Systemic Therapy">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Chemotherapy is a category of Systemic Therapy commonly used in the treatment of AML, targeting cancer cells throughout the body.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is a primary type of systemic therapy aimed at killing cancer cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is a type of Systemic Therapy employed in treating AML by targeting rapidly dividing cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Chemotherapy is a type of systemic therapy that targets cancer cells using specific drugs to kill fast-growing tumors.</data>
      <data key="d6">treatment category, cancer therapy&lt;SEP&gt;treatment category, cancer treatment&lt;SEP&gt;treatment type, cancer therapy</data>
